nts before being called on.\",tension:\"People project practical solutions onto you while you'd rather be left alone. The call out feels intrusive, but ignoring it entirely wastes your gifts.\",realLifeMoments:[\"Strangers expect things from you that feel unearned\",\"You have abilities that came naturally\\u2014you never had to struggle to learn them\",\"You need significant alone time or you start resenting the calls\",\"You've been blamed when someone's projection of you didn't match reality\"],truthShift:\"Your natural gifts will be seen whether you want them to be or not. The question is which calls deserve your response.\",tryThisInstead:\"Protect your retreat time. Only answer the calls that match what you're actually here to offer.\"},'6/2':{title:'6/2 Profile',subtitle:'The Role Model Natural',recognition:\"You're moving toward being someone others look to\\u2014a role model. And underneath that, you have natural gifts that need space to develop without pressure.\",tension:\"You feel the pull to lead but also the need to retreat. The world calls you out while part of you wants to stay hidden until you're ready.\",realLifeMoments:[\"You sense a shift from being in the mess to being above it\",\"You need alone time that others don't always understand\",\"People have called you a natural at things you never practiced\",\"You're still integrating the chaos of your earlier years\"],truthShift:\"You don't have to be finished to be worth following. Your natural evolution is the point. People learn by watching you become.\",tryThisInstead:\"Allow yourself to be seen in process. The role model energy isn't perfection\\u2014it's authentic integration.\"},'6/3':{title:'6/3 Profile',subtitle:'The Role Model Experimenter',recognition:\"Your path has been full of experiments\\u2014things that worked, things that didn't. Now you're shifting into something more visible: a life that others observe and learn from.\",tension:\"Your past feels messy compared to the role you're